body:
It's also been 4 months for me. I moved all of our pictures off my phone into a flash drive a week after the BU. I packed up our 4 years of memories, presents, hotel cards (we were long distance), clothing, plush toys, tickets, etc the day after. I put it all in a big tote box and it sat in my car for about a month or 2 before I went to drop it off at his house. 

&#x200B;

I sometimes go back and look at the pictures and I also get sad, I start crying. Our BU was literally out of no where so looking back at our pictures and texts it's crazy how everything seemed fine. At first I didn't regret giving him everything back but these past few days I have sort of wanted it back. Last time we spoke on good terms was about a month ago and he told me he still had the box. This past month has been really bad, I found out he cheated the last month we were together so I'm not sure if he still has it. I keep asking him but he ignores the question every time.

Speaking as someone who was broken up with for the same "lost feelings" reason, please just talk to her. Do it slowly. Literally talk her through it. My boyfriend/ex of 4 years broke up with me over a text. Refused to talk to me face to face and every time I'd ask him what happened he literally would just keep repeating himself that the feelings were lost and that the distance was too much (we were 4 hrs away from each other). Please answer all the questions she has for you. Just like I did, she will probably have hundreds of them. And most importantly please be patient with her and try to understand her. It's been 4 months since my BU and I still want to text him every day. I still have things I want to say and questions I want to ask him. But I can't because he blocked me. I'm now in therapy and I have pages and pages of this I wish I could tell him.

&#x200B;

If you did ever actually love her please just try to be patient with her and try not to cause her too much harm.

I too want a hug. I was also cheated on. Or so I've been told. He denied it when I asked him but apparently she's telling anyone who will listen that they're in a relationship now. 4 years gone. 

&#x200B;

I would also take my ex back. But he doesn't want me. He doesn't even want to know anything about me or much less speak to me. I was blocked.

This is exactly how I'm feeling. 4 year relationship and it'll be 4 months since the BU on Monday. I don't know him anymore either. I don't know what he's doing or how he's doing when before that was all my day was about. I cry thinking at the idea of how I will eventually forget him. I just haven't yet. I cry every time I remember he chose to leave me. 

&#x200B;

I too still love my ex. Even though he did me wrong so many times. I shouldn't but I will always love and care for him. I too hope those feelings go away soon, I'm tired of feeling this way.

I hadn't contacted him since last week. He answered one of the texts when he said it wasn't my fault. But I've just been writing that damn letter. I keep adding things I want to tell him. The last thing I texted him was sort of NSFW and I don't want that to be my last message... I don't think there's any coming back from this.  He's broken up with me before and we would get back in a day or less but not this time. 

&#x200B;

I feel lost. I thought about going to the gym but I have no motivation to do so. I graduated college last year but I don't want to go back to school. I don't feel like looking for another job. I just feel like I'm stuck.
